{"id":"a273d157ddbe764d","group":"72","path":"72/72-thm-system-t-subject-reduction.md","title":"System T归约保持类型与封闭性","display":"thm-system-t-subject-reduction — System T归约保持类型与封闭性","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-thm-system-t-subject-reduction","aliases":["72-thm-system-t-subject-reduction"],"display":"thm-system-t-subject-reduction — System T归约保持类型与封闭性","depends_on":["[[72-lem-system-t-typed-substitution]]","[[72-df-finite-type-arithmetic]]"],"chapter":"V","source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.V §§4.2–4.3 print358–360/PDF370–372; full local root-step/context proof","source_kind":"source-based-local-formalization","verification_status":"statement-and-local-argument-reviewed; not-machine-checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"review_2026_10_22_deep":"新增：接口、局部推导与来源边界逐项登记"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-thm-system-t-subject-reduction"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-thm-system-t-subject-reduction</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-system-t-subject-reduction — System T归约保持类型与封闭性"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ed136ba4b3f727b5\" href=\"?note=ed136ba4b3f727b5\" title=\"72-lem-system-t-typed-substitution\">72-lem-system-t-typed-substitution</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b4e2c27ac178897e\" href=\"?note=b4e2c27ac178897e\" title=\"72-df-finite-type-arithmetic\">72-df-finite-type-arithmetic</a></span></div>"},{"key":"chapter","html":"V"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.V §§4.2–4.3 print358–360/PDF370–372; full local root-step/context proof"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"source-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"statement-and-local-argument-reviewed; not-machine-checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"review_2026_10_22_deep","html":"新增：接口、局部推导与来源边界逐项登记"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta\\vdash_T^{ty}t:\\sigma\">\\(\\Delta\\vdash_T^{ty}t:\\sigma\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle t,u\\rangle\\in\\rho_T^*\">\\(\\langle t,u\\rangle\\in\\rho_T^*\\)</span>；所有归约均为本册的类型正确单孔上下文实例。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Delta\\vdash_T^{ty}u:\\sigma,\\qquad\\operatorname{FV}(u)\\subseteq\\operatorname{FV}(t).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Delta\\vdash_T^{ty}u:\\sigma,\\qquad\\operatorname{FV}(u)\\subseteq\\operatorname{FV}(t).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"t\\in\\mathcal T_\\sigma^c\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ u\\in\\mathcal T_\\sigma^c.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[t\\in\\mathcal T_\\sigma^c\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ u\\in\\mathcal T_\\sigma^c.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>一阶β根步用类型代入引理。Rσ a b 0的类型反演给a:σ；Rσ a b(S n)的反演给n:0、b:0→σ→σ，所以 b n(Rσ a b n):σ。三个根步的自由变量均为原项自由变量的子集。按单孔上下文归纳将结论提升到任意位置，再按有限归约长度归纳。该局部证明不以一般正规化为前提，故可以安全供数值正规化接口使用。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-lem-system-t-typed-substitution","status":"resolved","id":"ed136ba4b3f727b5","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-lem-system-t-typed-substitution]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-finite-type-arithmetic","status":"resolved","id":"b4e2c27ac178897e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-finite-type-arithmetic]]","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\Delta\\vdash_T^{ty}t:\\sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle t,u\\rangle\\in\\rho_T^*","display":false},{"tex":"\\Delta\\vdash_T^{ty}u:\\sigma,\\qquad\\operatorname{FV}(u)\\subseteq\\operatorname{FV}(t).","display":true},{"tex":"t\\in\\mathcal T_\\sigma^c\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ u\\in\\mathcal T_\\sigma^c.","display":true}],"bytes":1571,"backlinks":[{"id":"e6c99e2646691c7d","anchor":"ref-68","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"V章新增8项：[[72-df-system-t-normal-form]] · [[72-df-system-t-numerical-normalizer]] · [[72-df-system-t-typing-judgment]] · [[72-lem-system-t-typed-substitution]] · [[72-thm-system-t-closed-canonicity]] · [[72-thm-system-t-normalization]] · [[72-thm-system-t-numerical-adequacy]] · [[72-thm-system-t-subject-reduction]]"},{"id":"6aa9c9e25ba49583","anchor":"ref-64","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"V章新增8项：[[72-df-system-t-normal-form]] · [[72-df-system-t-numerical-normalizer]] · [[72-df-system-t-typing-judgment]] · [[72-lem-system-t-typed-substitution]] · [[72-thm-system-t-closed-canonicity]] · [[72-thm-system-t-normalization]] · [[72-thm-system-t-numerical-adequacy]] · [[72-thm-system-t-subject-reduction]]"},{"id":"45a40cdcc24cf331","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-64","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"V章新增8项：[[72-df-system-t-normal-form]] · [[72-df-system-t-numerical-normalizer]] · [[72-df-system-t-typing-judgment]] · [[72-lem-system-t-typed-substitution]] · [[72-thm-system-t-closed-canonicity]] · [[72-thm-system-t-normalization]] · [[72-thm-system-t-numerical-adequacy]] · [[72-thm-system-t-subject-reduction]]"},{"id":"d1bdc5d626d71488","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"类型、适型项、归约及正规形关系取 [[72-df-system-t-normal-form]]，类型保持见 [[72-thm-system-t-subject-reduction]]，合流性谓词见 [[72-df-confluence]]；$\\sigma\\in\\mathcal{Ty}$；$R_\\sigma:=\\rho_T\\cap\\mathcal T_\\sigma^2$。$\\operatorname{Conf}$、$\\operatorname{TNF}$ 取相同关系载体与 α 商。"}],"outgoing":["ed136ba4b3f727b5","b4e2c27ac178897e"]}